{"id":"633317","name":"可可双色面卷","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/633317/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"中筋面粉","amount":"600克"}],"sub":[{"name":"可可粉","amount":"10克"},{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"6克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"取一半量的面粉，放入3克酵母粉，5克糖混合。","img":"images/633317/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入温水和成软硬适中的面团，静置发酵。","img":"images/633317/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"另一半的面粉加入可可粉、5克糖、3克酵母粉。","img":"images/633317/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入适量温水和成软硬适中的面团，静置发酵。","img":"images/633317/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"夏天发酵快，大蜂窝状。","img":"images/633317/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"面团移至面板，揉匀排气。","img":"images/633317/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"擀成大片。","img":"images/633317/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"可可面团也做同样操作。","img":"images/633317/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"刷上少许清水。","img":"images/633317/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"覆盖另一种颜色的面片。","img":"images/633317/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"卷起来。","img":"images/633317/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"切段。","img":"images/633317/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"全部做好，二次发酵。","img":"images/633317/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放入蒸锅，蒸制18分钟，焖2分钟出锅。","img":"images/633317/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"暄软可口。","img":"images/633317/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}